'''Po Nudo''' was a [[Gender|male]] [[Ualaq]]<ref name="BMF 56" /> [[Aqualish]] who [[Senator|represented]]<ref name="Force">''[[Star Wars: Force Collection]]''</ref> his homeworld of [[Ando]]<ref name="Po Nudo">{{Databank|po-nudo|Po Nudo}}</ref> in the [[Galactic Republic]]'s [[Galactic Senate|Senate]] around the time that the [[Trade Federation]] [[Invasion of Naboo|invaded]] the [[planet]] [[Naboo]].<ref name="TPM" /> Ten [[Standard year|years]] later, he attended a secret meeting on the planet [[Geonosis]] where he and several other senators [[Geonosian accord|gave their support]] to the [[Sith Lord]] [[Count]] [[Dooku]] and left the Republic to form the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]. Shortly after the meeting the Republic arrived and the [[First Battle of Geonosis]] broke out, marking the start of the [[Clone Wars]] between the Republic and the Separatists and forcing Nudo to flee the planet.<ref name="AOTC" />

During the war the Aqualish senator withdrew from the Republic<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> and sat on the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]].<ref name="ROTS">{{Film|III}}</ref> He was assigned to be the manager of the [[Hyper-Communications Cartel]], which served as an alternative to the Republic-controlled [[HoloNet]].<ref name="OF84">{{GermanFanCite|84|Database}}</ref> In the later stages of the war, Nudo and the rest of the council were hidden on the planet [[Utapau]] being protected by the [[cyborg]] [[General]] [[Grievous]]. Following the [[Battle of Coruscant]] and the [[death]] of Dooku, Grievous informed the council that he had been ordered to move them to another world, but during the meeting the [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] interrupted and attacked Grievous, starting the [[Battle of Utapau]] during which the council fled and were relocated to the [[Volcano|volcanic]] world of [[Mustafar]]. Once the Clone Wars drew to a close, [[Darth Sidious]]&mdash;who had secretly been the true leader of the Separatists all along as well as [[Supreme Chancellor]] of the Republic&mdash;sent his new apprentice [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] to Mustafar where he [[Mission to Mustafar|killed]] all of the Separatist council including Nudo.<ref name="ROTS" />

[[Standard decade|Decades]] later, Nudo was mentioned as having been a notable Aqualish in "[[Species From A to Z]]," a survival compendium sent out by [[Carson Teva]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="OSWM">{{GermanFanCite|112|Database}}</ref>

